  "name": "Gcloud Cli Health Check",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scheduled health check plugin for the Google Cloud CLI (gcloud). Verifies that gcloud is installed, authenticated, the active project is correct, critical APIs are enabled, billing is linked, and Cloud Run services are live. Saves a structured report to the workspace.",
